DESCRIPTION:Get Safety Certification in Woodworking! \n \n \n\n \n This ti
 me is reserved for members of TTLMakerspace - if you're new to the shop\, 
 this is the place to get started with woodworking. \n \n \n\n \n Need your
  TTLMakerspace membership? \n \n \n\n \n Find it Here \n \n \n\n \n Learn 
 how to safely use the following woodshop tools:  \n \n \n- \n Table Saw \
 n\n- \n Thickness Planer \n\n- \n Jointer \n\n- \n Router Table \n\n- \n B
 and Saw \n\n- \n Sliding Compound Mitre Saw \n\n- \n Belt Sander \n\n- \n 
 Drill Press \n\n \n \n Certification is required before TTLMakerspace mem
 bers can use our tools independently. \n \n \n\n \n Certifications for all
  courses are valid for one year from the time that they are issued\, and c
 an be renewed with an instructor at no cost with your active monthly membe
 rship within 3 months of their expiry. \n \n \n \n\n \n \n Want to get not
 ified next time classes are posted? \n\n Join our mailing list!
LOCATION:TTLMakerspace\, 192 Spadina Ave.\, Toronto\, ON
URL:https://ttlmarket.com/products/members-woodshop-certification-nov-14
